<td align=center valign=top width=380>
<h1><font face="helvetica" color="#ff4040">File Not Found.</font></h1>
<font face="helvetica" color="#ff00ff">The file is deceased.</font>
<br>
<font face="helvetica" color="#e700e7">It is no longer.  It has passed on.
</font><br><font face="helvetica" color="#cf00cf">
You can not have that file in this life!
</font><br><font face="helvetica" color="#b700b7">
The file is dead, lifeless, departed, demised, late, extinct, no more.
</font>
<br>
<font face="helvetica" color="#af00af">
It has broken on through to the other side.
<br></font>

<br>

<table border=0 cellpadding=5 cellspacing=0 width=380
<tr bgcolor="#404040">
<td align=left valign=top>

<a href="http://www.eskimo.com/~nanook">
<img vspace=6 hspace=6 align=left height=109 width=79 alt="Nanook Head"
src="http://www.eskimo.com/img/pics/nanook.jpg"></a>
	
<p><font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>
I'm sorry we couldn't meet under better circumstances.
</font></p>

<p><font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>
As long as you are here, let me introduce myself.  My name is Robert
Dinse, also known as &quot;Nanook&quot;.  You can e-mail me at </font><a
href="mailto:nanook@eskimo.com"><font face="helvetica"
size=2>nanook@eskimo.com</font></a>.<br><font face="helvetica"
color="#ffffc0" size=2> Please visit </font><a
href="http://www.eskimo.com/~nanook/blog"><font face="helvetica"
size=2>my blog</font></a><font
face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2> or </font>
<a href="http://www.eskimo.com/~nanook"><font face="helvetica"
size=2>my home page</font></a>.</p>

<p><font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>
I started Eskimo North as a bulletin board system in 1982. Evolved into
the full service ISP offering web and game hosting, shells, mail lists,
e-mail, dial, ISDN, and DSL access.  Toll free customer support, no phone
trees or scripts.
</font></p>

<p><font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>
We have not been acquired.  Eskimo North remains independently owned and
operated.  The emphasis here is on our service, not on wheeling and
dealing.  Your needs are important to us.
</font></p>

<p><font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>
While you are here, please take advantage of our</font>
<a href="http://www.eskimo.com/newuser.html"><font face="helvetica"
color="000000" size=2> two-week free trial</font></a>
<font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>of our</font>
<a href="http://linux-friendly-56k.com/">
<font face="helvetica" size=2>56k</font></a>,
<a href="http://128k-isdn-access.com/">
<font face="helvetica" size=2>ISDN</font></a>,
<font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>and</font>
<a href="http://www.eskimo.com/services/shells.html">
<font face="helvetica" size=2>remote shell</font></a> 
<font face="helvetica" color="#ffffc0" size=2>services.  You will not be
disappointed.</font></p>

</td>
